{"slug":"j-d-l","ar":"ج د ل","total":29,"core":"dispute","forms":[{"ar":"جَٰدَلُ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":25,"gloss":"to dispute, argue","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":68,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِن","جَـٰدَلُوكَ","فَقُلِ","ٱللَّهُ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"And if they dispute with you, then say, \"Allah is most knowing of what you do"}},{"ar":"جَدَل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"argument, quarrelsomeness","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":54,"p":14,"ar":["وَلَقَدْ","صَرَّفْنَا","فِى","هَـٰذَا","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","لِلنَّاسِ","مِن","كُلِّ","مَثَلٍ ۚ","وَكَانَ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","أَكْثَرَ","شَىْءٍ","جَدَلًا"],"en":"And We have certainly diversified in this Qur'an for the people from every [kind of] example; but man has ever been, most of anything, [prone to] dispute"}},{"ar":"جِدَال","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"disputing, quarrel","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":32,"p":6,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","يَـٰنُوحُ","قَدْ","جَـٰدَلْتَنَا","فَأَكْثَرْتَ","جِدَٰلَنَا","فَأْتِنَا","بِمَا","تَعِدُنَآ","إِن","كُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ"],"en":"They said, \"O Noah, you have disputed us and been frequent in dispute of us. So bring us what you threaten us, if you should be of the truthful"}}],"surahs":[[40,5],[4,3],[11,3],[22,3],[6,2],[16,2],[18,2],[2,1],[7,1],[8,1],[13,1],[29,1],[31,1],[42,1],[43,1],[58,1]]}